'''Kuudra&#39;s End''' was a [[Location]] on the {{zone|Crimson Isle}}, and is where the [[Kuudra]] fight took place. 

== Purpose ==
{{zone|Kuudra's End}} was where [[Kuudra]] spawns, and the fight took place. It was a massive space, with a bridge leading to what resembled a ship, surrounded by {{Item|Lava}}. {{NPCSprite|Elle}} would fish up [[Kuudra]] and cause the bridge to collapse. [[Kuudra]] and its tentacles spawned in the {{Item|Lava}} around the ship.

